ap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/2b40726ae03b93fe03559b1d6e6b19f8.avif?t=1770328668\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/c6e0c73627424a8773ec04878abe54f5.avif?t=1770328668\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The camera doesn't lie, but the truth isn't always obvious. Step into the role of a detective investigating crime scenes where every detail matters and every photograph could be the key to solving the case.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your camera, you'll document crucial evidence at crime scenes - photograph traces, examine objects from every angle, and capture details that reveal the story behind each crime. Every piece of evidence you gather builds toward one goal: identifying the murderer and predicting their next strike before another victim falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/d8de7e8cfb1a08c8dd6fa4e23749223c.poster.avif?t=1770328668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/d8de7e8cfb1a08c8dd6fa4e23749223c.webm?t=1770328668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/d8de7e8cfb1a08c8dd6fa4e23749223c.mp4?t=1770328668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back at your detective office, the real investigation begins. Link clues on your detective board, connecting photographs, evidence, and leads until patterns emerge. Search police databases for key information - verify suspects, cross-reference data, and uncover connections that others have missed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/7b506c67518ee52866fb130b0439ace3.poster.avif?t=1770328668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/7b506c67518ee52866fb130b0439ace3.webm?t=1770328668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/7b506c67518ee52866fb130b0439ace3.mp4?t=1770328668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: identify the culprit and determine where they'll strike again. Each case presents a standalone mystery with its own unique crime scenes, evidence, and suspects. Some cases will test your observation skills, others will challenge your deductive reasoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The truth is out there, waiting to be photographed, analyzed, and solved.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/551a6a18e145467394706c789caa9142.poster.avif?t=1770328668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/551a6a18e145467394706c789caa9142.webm?t=1770328668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/551a6a18e145467394706c789caa9142.mp4?t=1770328668\" type=\"video